  "description": ".NET library for Atmel/Microchip SAM-BA firmware flashing over USB CDC — device discovery, chip identification (SAM7/SAM3/SAM4/SAM9XE/SAMx7x/SAMD21/SAMD51), flash erase/write/verify, GPNVM boot configuration, lock regions and security bit. Applet-free port of BOSSA. Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, macOS (device discovery and hot-plug watching are Windows-only).",
